{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0573_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cb868bbc4b5beb45296184dcc6742a4968da70aef94607f1eade3663125ccfd5", "ja": "（今日はエレナのコスプレグラビア企画の撮影だ。\nヒョウに扮した衣装で撮影をする……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄艾蕾娜的角色扮演写真企划。将穿着扮成豹子的服装进行拍摄……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0573_1001_p", "source_sha256": "99fdeda33cad5999e078062133c2c068d659b6407737d74dc79c4192b84c1dc2", "ja": "お疲れ様、エレナ。\nもうすぐ撮影が始まりそうだけど、支度は……。", "zh": "辛苦了，艾莲娜。\n拍摄好像马上就要开始了，你准备得……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0573_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "6ff98207c00e4a8b9d92f14eb7bb9950648c7dd73ed752365ec6bea212c5b712", "ja": "あ、{$P$}……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0573_1003_p", "source_sha256": "74477c1b85d2e7c7cbdb49fdc0e199a62dce624e2a4ea7e870976902f736c9eb", "ja": "え、エレナ？\nどうした、何か問題でもあったか？", "zh": "咦，艾蕾娜？\n怎么了，出什么问题了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0573_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "a0b5127112d641e36a47664fee6f085f669ee5874263cf156a5e714df8931ed5", "ja": "問題ってわけじゃないケド……。ポーズの参考になるか\nと思って、ヒョウについて調べてたノ。", "zh": "倒也不是有什么问题……我只是想着能不能拿来\n当姿势的参考，所以就去查了查猎豹的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0573_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "219c9ac22238c9d3f0a8b15a92309bf444092fb5fb1c3e98bdaf10754252d636", "ja": "ヒョウって、狩りの時、すっごく怖い顔するんだネ。\nワタシ、ちょっとビックリしちゃった。", "zh": "豹子捕猎时，会露出特别可怕的表情呢。\n我都有点吓到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0573_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4d20593841b8bb8e5e0964c99f111c889221d94b13ed068a5ee38f0a4d0c3393", "ja": "そうだな。ヒョウも、必死なんだと思うよ。\n餌の有無は生死に関わってくるからな。", "zh": "是啊。我想豹子也是拼尽全力的吧。\n毕竟有没有食物，可是关系到生死的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0573_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "90179418406bc16e725876e127cf8c08899ff667582486e83acc2e3aac44fe13", "ja": "そっか……。怖いイメージがあるなら、ワタシも\n怖いポーズとか表情をした方がいいのかナ……？", "zh": "这样啊……既然给人一种可怕的印象，那我是不是也该摆出可怕的姿势，做出可怕的表情呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0573_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a3cde8106d0fb9846eea8e0565689caba24b95c39ebb2e6a2730f77ecdf1571c", "ja": "そうだな……。\nでもここは、エレナの笑顔の見せどころじゃないか？", "zh": "是啊……\n不过这种时候，不正是展现艾丽娜笑容的机会吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0573_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "8f477cad9f8fcd675c17b07886ac23a8fe700fb9ed8cd53f64abbcf5110021af", "ja": "え……っ？　ワタシの笑顔……そんなに怖い？", "zh": "诶……？我的笑容……有那么可怕吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0573_1010_p", "source_sha256": "2ce5b708c817f101cd8bbe888f3df6d8863f50d70c6d701712fa15b907110775", "ja": "違う違うっ！　怖そうなイメージもあるから、\nエレナの笑顔で、可愛いヒョウにするんだよ。", "zh": "不是不是！因为本来就有点吓人的印象，所以想用艾丽娜的笑容，把它变成一只可爱的豹。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0573_1011_p", "source_sha256": "7e55f7534985039184d2e79ec44d8ed419f7d67a0222a5dd96898631d843c592", "ja": "写真を見た人が、こんなに可愛いなら\n友達になりたいって、思ってくれるように。", "zh": "希望看照片的人觉得它这么可爱，也想和它成为朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0573_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "151e6b07f4af1466e0c41208bd75161320b9563cbc06dfaae062dbd29d05dacb", "ja": "見た人が、友達に……。\nエヘヘ。わかったよ、{$P$}！", "zh": "看到照片的人，会想成为朋友……。\n嘿嘿。我明白啦，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0573_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "5006169a58f2d0c1420e60798b616dd2a2a542996547347f26121e3ba313d32f", "ja": "調べた時、ネコみたいにカワイイ写真もあったし、\n赤ちゃんのヒョウも、フワフワでキュートだもんネ♪", "zh": "我查资料的时候，还看到过像猫咪一样可爱的照片，而且小豹子也是毛茸茸的，超可爱呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0573_1014_p", "source_sha256": "0972e7736eca07e836aa4159b97b1b3c043b7cdca536610564f33ade4b8866e7", "ja": "そうそう。\nだからこそ、この役はエレナにピッタリだと思う。", "zh": "对对。\n正因为如此，我觉得这个角色非常适合艾蕾娜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0573_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "95feb318bc4bb3bdb5884f83573d78016df9f81bdbee679cad00519304a2b47d", "ja": "エヘヘ、ありがと♪\nワタシ、ちょっと考えすぎちゃってたかも。", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢♪\n我可能有点想太多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0573_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "9fed389a183f1d5e68ee9eee55825a78be6bc521eb78b810cf91d9b72f5ebc46", "ja": "ヒョウだって、友達ができたらうれしいよネ。ウン！\nワタシも頑張ってカワイイヒョウをアピールするヨ～♪", "zh": "就算是豹，有了朋友也会很开心吧。嗯！\n我也会加油，好好展现可爱的豹哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0573_1017_p", "source_sha256": "d17f43379681bd7c3803469ed66eba41e684f001a18a041149f0094539c959e8", "ja": "（その後、エレナは笑顔と持ち前の元気さで、撮影に\n挑んだ。エレナの魅力を活かした一枚になったな！）", "zh": "（之后，艾琳娜带着笑容和与生俱来的活力投入了拍摄。这张照片充分展现了艾琳娜的魅力！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
